# KVKK / GDPR

- No LLM call bypasses the layer: input redact → model → output scan → audit log.
- Legal bases and purpose limitation are stored on the audit event.
- User delete: platform PII gone or anonymized; LLM logs stripped; optional generated-project wipe if the user owns it.
- Export: user can receive their platform data. Do not silently include other org members’ data.
- Temp mailbox content is PII with short TTL.
- Generated customer source may contain end-user PII after the customer runs the app — Icerde still must not send raw project secrets to the LLM.
- Read [docs/gdpr-kvkk.md](docs/gdpr-kvkk.md).
